						const body = "\nTime and Labor functionality in Oracle Fusion HCM manages employee work hours, attendance, and timekeeping requirements across the organization.\n\n## Time and Labor Architecture\n\nThe Time and Labor module integrates:\n- Time entry and tracking\n- Attendance management\n- Leave administration\n- Payroll integration\n\n## Timesheet Configuration\n\nEstablish timesheet structure for your organization:\n\n### Timesheet Period\n- Duration: Weekly, bi-weekly, monthly\n- Start and end dates\n- Approval deadlines\n- Payment period alignment\n\n### Work Schedule\nDefine expected work patterns:\n- Full-time schedules\n- Part-time arrangements\n- Shift-based work\n- Flexible schedules\n\n## Recording Time Entries\n\nEmployees submit time through various methods:\n- Mobile applications\n- Web-based timesheets\n- Time clocks\n- Integration with badge systems\n\n### Entry Types\n- Regular Hours: Standard work time\n- Overtime: Time exceeding normal hours\n- Leave: Absence periods\n- Adjustments: Corrections to prior entries\n\n## Attendance Management\n\nTrack and manage employee presence:\n\n### Attendance Policies\n- Punctuality requirements\n- Absence reporting procedures\n- Documentation requirements\n- Disciplinary actions\n\n### Absence Types\n- Paid Time Off\n- Unpaid Leave\n- Sick Leave\n- Bereavement\n- Maternity/Paternity\n\n## Leave Administration\n\nManage leave entitlements and accruals:\n\n### Leave Setup\n- Accrual rules: How leave is earned\n- Carryover: Unused leave handling\n- Usage restrictions: When leave applies\n- Documentation: Supporting records\n\n### Leave Request Process\n1. Employee requests leave\n2. Manager approval\n3. Leave deduction from balance\n4. Payroll notification\n\n## Approval Workflows\n\nEstablish multi-level approval structures:\n- Manager review and approval\n- Department head sign-off\n- Compliance validation\n- Final authorization\n\n## Payroll Integration\n\nTime and labor data flows to payroll:\n- Hours worked calculations\n- Overtime identification\n- Leave processing\n- Earnings determination\n\n## Reporting Capabilities\n\nTime and Labor generates reports for:\n- Timesheet Summary: Hours by employee\n- Attendance Report: Presence tracking\n- Leave Usage: Accrual and consumption\n- Payroll Input: Hour submission to payroll\n\n## Compliance Considerations\n\nEnsure compliance with labor regulations:\n- Wage and hour laws\n- Overtime regulations\n- Leave requirements\n- Accessibility requirements\n\n## Best Practices\n\n1. **Establish clear policies** communicated to all employees\n2. **Configure approval workflows** matching organization\n3. **Integrate with payroll** for accurate processing\n4. **Monitor exceptions** for policy violations\n5. **Maintain audit trails** for compliance\n\n## Conclusion\n\nProper Time and Labor configuration ensures accurate hour tracking, compliance with regulations, and seamless payroll processing. Invest in clear policies and thorough implementation for optimal results.\n";
